# This repository holds the tools and nothing else. What follows blocks shapes that would be an
# incident the moment they appeared — not because anyone expects them to, but because **nothing
# else would stop them** if they did.
#
# ~/.claude holds private conversation transcripts and snapshots of edited files.
# Keep this repository outside that directory. These exclusions provide an additional guard
# against accidentally copying local state into the checkout.
*.jsonl
history*
projects/
file-history/
shell-snapshots/
sessions/
paste-cache/
image-cache/
*.log

# Your registry. It holds the absolute path of every project on your machine and often the
# health endpoints of things you run — it is yours, it is seeded from the example by install.sh,
# and it must never arrive here by accident.
project-icons.json

# originals kept aside during install
*.pre-symlink

__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# Serena's local index and notes can contain private project information.
.serena/
